<title>USA: Selfcare Inc Q2 full results.</title>
<headline>Selfcare Inc Q2 full results.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>2nd Quarter (April 1 - June 30)</p>
<p>						    1996	    1995</p>
<p> Revenue				   $2,828,127    $1,694,457</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)(A)		   2,706,574   (1,264,437)</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss) Per Common</p>
<p>  and Common Equivalent Share(A)	   0.44	  (0.22)</p>
<p>NOTE(A): 2nd Quarter 1996 includes $5.0 million of income from a reversal of a portion of non-cash charges recorded in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>						  6 Months Ended June 30,</p>
<p>							1996	    1995</p>
<p> Revenue				     $5,297,528   $ 3,030,433</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)(B)		  (13,609,750)   (2,171,196)</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss) Per Common</p>
<p>  and Common Equivalent Share(B)	   (2.22)	  (0.38)</p>
<p>NOTE(B): 6 months 1996 figures include non-cash,</p>
<p>non-recurring charges of $8.8 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
